{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36167","headline":"题睦州乌龙山禅居 · 方干","name":"题睦州乌龙山禅居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曙後月华犹冷湿，自知坐卧逼天宫。\n晨鸡未暇鸣山底，早日先来照屋东。\n人世驱驰方丈内，海波摇动一杯中。\n伴师长住应难住，归去仍须入俗笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}